BO some of those are  moving faster than others as is always  the case with development none of them  have been greenlate yet though we are  hoping maybe soon now a couple of them  have been shelved but I would not agree  that they are dead you can take  something off the shelf as easily as you  can set it on the Shelf alright so as  you can see George RR Martin said HBO  has set at least one of the Game of  Thrones successor shows on the Shelf he  did not mention what show so I'm not  sure why so many fans are saying the Jon  Snow series is dead for all we know the  Jon Snow show is one of the shows that's  moving along faster than the others as  he mentioned in the update remember they  still have several shows in development  at HBO they have been working on shows  about nymeria the sea snake Jon Snow and  Duncan egg out of those four shows alone  I would say the Jon Snow show has some  of the best odds of getting made  considering it's directly connected to  their flagship show as you all know Game  of Thrones is their Mothership and Jon  Snow was its commander-in-chief if one  of these shows did get set on the back  burner my guess is it's the show about  nymeria but that's only speculation as  of right now no one can confirm what  shows are moving forward unless George  RR Martin or someone at HBO makes an  official announcement so make sure you  set the record straight if you see  anyone saying the Jon Snow show is no  longer getting made now in other recent  news one of House of the dragon's  writers reveals they are finishing the  writing for House of the Dragon season  finale of its second season and they  said the fans will not be disappointed  they're essentially hyping up what might  be one of the greatest moments from the  series in a new article written by  variety its headline reads House of the  dragon's writer teases season 2's blood  and cheese now those words or I should  say those names should strike fear in  the hearts of those who have read George  R Martin's Fire and Blood so some of you  might be wondering what is blood and  cheese and why is it going to be such a  big deal without giving away any Major  Spoilers from Martin's Fire and Blood  The Song of Ice and Fire novel that  describes the Targaryen family history  and serves as the source material for  House of the Dragon Blood and cheese are  the nicknames given to the characters  who are responsible for carrying out a  Revenge plot against Allison amond king  aegon and the greens on behalf of Damon  and rhaenera Targaryen and the blacks  following renera's son lucari's death at  the hands of Amen on the Game of Thrones  series Luke's death is depicted as  somewhat of an accident with Eamonn  looking shocked following the Fatal  outcome of their dragon fight in the  season 1 finale  wait  wait my Lord strong  now whether the death was unintentional  or not House of the Dragon writer Sarah  Hess has confirmed HBO's successor show  will include the blood and cheese plot  that followed Luke's death in the novel  a brutal trade that fire and blood's  demon describes as an eye for an eye a  sun for a son we are currently writing  the finale of season two hess told  variety when asked last month if the  house of the Dragon writer's room had  already wrote the on-screen version of  the infamous blood and cheese storyline  she finishes her interview by saying I  don't think you will be disappointed so  as you can see according to variety  House of the Dragon writer Sarah Hess  has already confirmed we will without a  doubt see blood and cheese next season  now I don't know about all of you but  this makes me very excited although I  did already assume this would happen  two men were found one was a former gold  cloak the other a rat catcher in the red  keep who knew all its secrets  history remembers them only as blood and  one night Queen Helena entered the Royal  apartments with her daughter and two  sons to put them to bed without warning  blood and cheese bursting daggers in  hand they told her that a debt was owed  a son for a son blood and cheese  demanded she choose which Sun would be  ripped from her forever  Queen Helena pleaded with the man to  kill her instead but they refused  weeping Helena named her younger son  Melo  perhaps she thought the boy was too  young to understand  perhaps because the older boy was King  aegon's first-born son and Heir you hear  that little boy she's whispered to the  younger son your mama wants you dead  then blood struck off the older boy's  head with a single blow when the guards  burst in they found Queen Helena still  screaming clasping her dead son's body  to her mad with grief  the blood of their children transformed  a dynastic dispute into a war of  annihilation  the grief and rage of losing a child  could burn down the world  it does already seem like the second  season will be far better than the first  there has been a lot of new information  getting released regarding the filming  of the second season I will be making a  separate video about all of that so I  hope I will see all of you back here for  that one as well let me know what you  think about these recent updates and  announcements I'm interested in hearing  what you have to say as always I want to  thank all of you for watching another  video now that the holidays are over I  hope everyone has an amazing New Year  have a great day everyone I will see you  again very soon bye  foreign  [Music]  [Music]  foreign

